From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Anthony Fu <github@antfu.me>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 13:30:10 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] feat(app): pick a host icon and show it in host pickers

A host could only be told apart by its name and its color, and the color
only showed in sidebar badges. Host appearance now has an icon too, picked
next to the color in the host's settings. Badges draw it, and host pickers
draw the host's icon in its color with the status dot on its corner. A host
with no icon and no color keeps the bare status dot.

The icon is per-device, like the color, and optional in the stored
registry, so registries saved before it still parse.

Fork-Change: F-9
